From e9d580b0f87d4d4485e9f8ff205ee8ed71695331 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rl-ios-port <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:44:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ARM64EC: read the TEB from Darwin TSD slot 6 when x18 is not
 preserved

With FEX_TEB_IN_DARWIN_TSD (Wine on Apple ARM64), JIT-emitted TEB loads, Module.S
and the ARM64EC module's C++ read the TEB from pthread TSD slot 6
(TPIDRRO_EL0 + 0x30), which Wine keeps current per thread, instead of x18, which
the Darwin kernel does not preserve. Stock builds are unchanged.

Local patch for a private port; not for upstream submission (see DECISIONS D-008).
---
